---
title: LLM Inference Simulator
endpoints:
  - name: LLM Inference Sim
    url: http://localhost:30802/v1
    note: OpenAI-compatible
---
Model     gpt-4o (echo mode: responses mirror the request)
Usage     real prompt/completion token counts in every response

Health    GET /health    Ready  GET /ready    Metrics  GET /metrics

  curl -s http://localhost:30802/v1/chat/completions \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"model":"gpt-4o","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"hello"}]}'
